// A call with no arguments is not a constant: cycle() > 3 has to be read
// every cycle. It came back as an immediate 0, so the comparison folded to
// false and Late never went on -- and `tick() > 1000` the same. N keeps the
// program running: one that changes nothing stops after its first cycles.
#variable N = 0
#variable Late = 0
N = N + 1
Late = 1 ? cycle() > 3
